# WET PAINT: the mother gloop is fast; every few seconds she slows down and
# lays a little gloop, then speeds up again. A garage sends her out with a
# little one at her side.
game wetpaint
wait 5
cheat course 7
cheat noclock
cheat go
expect garages == 1
waituntil foes_biggloop >= 1 200
waituntil foes_gloop >= 1 60
cheat nogarages
cheat killall
cheat put biggloop 0 7 0
wait 230
expect foes_gloop == 0
wait 70
expect foes_gloop == 1
expect foes_biggloop == 1
